  triage:description "AX.5 QA-2 (quality-mgr ax5-qa-r2, PR #1201 Final Quality Report 2026-09-05T14:22Z) at head fbee74ba8a9abf0b3e04b01bc157b8a65f194119. req-qa ATM-QA-001/002/003: the sprint doc Required validation demands tests for AC1 (the ack/--task-complete leg advances the pump to the next task), AC2 (17-member reminder-only budget split: 16 prompted this tick, the 17th next tick) and AC4 (reminder-path breaker-open and select_emitter -> None: no Reminded row written while open, resumes when closed). None of ax5_01..ax5_08 or ac03_* exercise these paths; the closest (ac02, ax5_04) cover drain-budget and a non-breaker error instead. AX5-QA1-002 (foundAt 12:38Z) is superseded by this record for the AC1/AC2/AC4 legs; AC6/AC7 legs are closed. Fix: add one deterministic clock-seam test per AC1, AC2 and AC4 in the crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake.rs tests module (or a sibling tests file if RULE-003 line caps require), matching the AC wording literally." ;
